From: jetbee <7734987+jetbee@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Keyguard: no keyguard presentation on the A6L E-ink
 display

The A6L E-ink is an external display (FLAG_PRESENTATION, FLAG_SECURE)
that mirrors the default display. While the keyguard is showing,
KeyguardDisplayManager put its keyguard presentation on it, so it
stopped mirroring the default display, where the keyguard and its PIN
pad are, and the panel stayed white. When ro.hmct.epd.support is "1",
isKeyguardShowable() now returns false for external displays.

Implemented from cleanroom spec 02-epd-service.md (section 10 item 1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
